# Files in the repo that should NOT be published to the public website.
# (Code still lives on GitHub; this only controls what Cloudflare serves.)
# Cloudflare Workers asset uploads max out at 25 MiB per file — without
# ignoring .git, Workers Builds tries to upload the pack file (~174 MiB)
# and fails ("Asset too large").
.git/
.github/
.wrangler/
node_modules/
admin.html
*.md
character-sheets/
tools/